        ]
      },
      {
        "heading": "Practical Interpretation",
        "body": "The practical takeaway is cautious optimism. The review identifies credible mechanisms for quantum advantage and credible hardware trajectories, including annealers, photonic chips, cloud-accessible processors, and qRAM research. But it treats input, output, costing, and benchmarking as first-class scientific problems, meaning a useful quantum machine learning result must demonstrate complete workflow advantage, not just an isolated fast subroutine.",
